{
  "title": "Small Claims Tribunal Enquiry",
  "type": "gap_fill_exercise",
  "dialogue": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Good afternoon. How can I help you?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "speaker": "Emily Jane",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Good afternoon, I'd like to lodge a claim." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Certainly. Name?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "speaker": "Emily Jane",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Emily-Jane Appleby." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Appleby—" },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q1" },
        { "type": "text", "value": "—sorry, what did you say your first name was again?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "speaker": "Emily Jane",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Emily-Jane." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Now, Ms Appleby, could you please " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q2" },
        { "type": "text", "value": "?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "speaker": "Emily Jane",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "I've never done that before. Can you help me?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Yes, of course. The first part is for your, the claimant's, details. Where do you live?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "speaker": "Emily Jane",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Um...At 1 Yeronga Street, Durham." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "How do you spell Durham?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "speaker": "Emily Jane",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "D-U-R-H-A-M." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Of course, I should know that—but it's just " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q3" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " quite different from the way you spell it." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "speaker": "Emily Jane",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "It is confusing—" },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q4" },
        { "type": "text", "value": "." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "And what's the postcode for Durham?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "speaker": "Emily Jane",
      "text": [
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q5" },
        { "type": "text", "value": "." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Good. And...do you work?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "speaker": "Emily Jane",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "No, not at the moment." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Okay, " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q6" },
        { "type": "text", "value": ". What about a home phone number?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "speaker": "Emily Jane",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Yes, I can give you that. It's 7848 3762." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "7848..." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "speaker": "Emily Jane",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "3762." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Right. Now this part here is for " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q7" },
        { "type": "text", "value": "." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "speaker": "Emily Jane",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Who's the respondent?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "The individual person, company or business " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q8" },
        { "type": "text", "value": ". Is the claim against " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q9" },
        { "type": "text", "value": "?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "speaker": "Emily Jane",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Well, it's a company " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q10" },
        { "type": "text", "value": "." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "So, that's 'trader' then. Just a moment while I write that down." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "speaker": "Emily Jane",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "ABC Appliances actually." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Oh, now, " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q11" },
        { "type": "text", "value": ". If the respondent is a company you must have the company's full and correct name and " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q12" },
        { "type": "text", "value": "." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "speaker": "Emily Jane",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "I've looked it up on the Internet and it's ABC Appliances Limited." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Good. If we don't get this part absolutely right, " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q13" },
        { "type": "text", "value": ". And their registered address?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "speaker": "Emily Jane",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Yes, " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q14" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " Just a minute...it's um...17 Brown Avenue." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "That's in Bardon, isn't it? I think I know the place—" },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q15" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " last month." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "speaker": "Emily Jane",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Yes, Bardon." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Have you got the postcode for Bardon?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "speaker": "Emily Jane",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "It's really similar to mine—wait a moment—" },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q16" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " I get it right. 4065, that's it." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "And what's the telephone number for ABC Appliances?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "speaker": "Emily Jane",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Oh, um..." },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q17" },
        { "type": "text", "value": "." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Good. Got that...now, in the third part of this form we get to " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q18" },
        { "type": "text", "value": ". I assume you " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q19" },
        { "type": "text", "value": "?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "speaker": "Emily Jane",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Yes, that's right, on the third of February 2011." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "And did the goods have any sort of " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q20" },
        { "type": "text", "value": "?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "speaker": "Emily Jane",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Yes, but only for six months." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "So, it was " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q21" },
        { "type": "text", "value": "?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "speaker": "Emily Jane",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Yes, they offered me an extended warranty for 3 years but " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q22" },
        { "type": "text", "value": "." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Oh, I see." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "You'll need to " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q23" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " the goods involved, the nature of the defect or fault and any " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q24" },
        { "type": "text", "value": "...so, tell me, what did you buy?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "speaker": "Emily Jane",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "I bought " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q25" },
        { "type": "text", "value": "..." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Ye..es...but what brand, model and serial number?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "speaker": "Emily Jane",
      "text": [
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q26" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " 'Mallard' and it was the 'Whisper' model; " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q27" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " I've got the warranty papers in my bag. Yes, here it is, serial number " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q28" },
        { "type": "text", "value": "." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Great. Now I need to know how much you agreed to pay." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "speaker": "Emily Jane",
      "text": [
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q29" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Did you trade in your old machine?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "speaker": "Emily Jane",
      "text": [
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q30" },
        { "type": "text", "value": ", I did." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Okay...now what were you given for the trade-in?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "speaker": "Emily Jane",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "250 pounds..." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "So, in actual fact, the purchase price you agreed on was 750 pounds?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "speaker": "Emily Jane",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "That's right and " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q31" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " two days later on the fifth of March and picked up the trade-in at the same time." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Now, think carefully about this next question. What did the respondent say about " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q32" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " or the way they would perform?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "speaker": "Emily Jane",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "The salesman " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q33" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " said 'The Mallard Whisper model has a much shorter cycle so " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q34" },
        { "type": "text", "value": "'—oh, and he added: 'and it will also use less water'." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Is that true?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "speaker": "Emily Jane",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Well, partly...it does seem to use less water but both the wash cycle and the rinse cycle go on for much longer than my old machine " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q35" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " But the sales assistant also said: 'This model is whisper quiet'." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "speaker": "Officer",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "And is it?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "speaker": "Emily Jane",
      "text": [
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio33_q36" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " we can't hear the television in the next room." }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
